  "solution": "**Given**\n\n(1/2 + 3/4) ÷ (1/5 + 3/10)\n\n**Calculations**\n\n⇒ (1/2 + 3/4) = 1.25\n\n⇒ (1/5 + 3/10) = 0.5\n\n⇒ 1.25 ÷ 0.5 = 2.50\n\n**Therefore, the value of (1/2 + 3/4) ÷ (1/5 + 3/10) lies between 2.3 and 2.6.**",
